            <title>[IGNITE-8530] Exchange hangs during start/stop stress test</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8530</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please see attached test, it starts N_CORES*2+2 nodes first and after this starts&#160;N_CORES*2 threads with while(true) cycle in which closes and starts nodes with small random pause.&lt;/p&gt;

